        "id": 1000056
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-06-22T20:42:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What\u0027s the content of name?   How to you guarantee that the name is not reused across a cluster?   It\u0027s better to add an Id (in a similar way as a device id) and use that  as a key.   This will scale better as that id would be prefixed by the voltha instance id, hence making it unique across the cluster and also will be consistent with the existing rpcs.",
      "revId": "5d2aae373ebbdf8be698fb00cb2c3502a2c5dd14",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5a202591_f54a7826",
        "filename": "voltha/protos/voltha.proto",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 98,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000228
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-06-26T20:53:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The id is the name.\nFYI, bbf standard yang model WT-385:\nhttps://wiki.opencord.org/display/CORD/vOLTHA+-+xPON+Hardware+Abstraction?preview\u003d/2555912/2556857/WT-385_draft1.pdf",
      "parentUuid": "9a0e1d27_65fead6d",
      "revId": "5d2aae373ebbdf8be698fb00cb2c3502a2c5dd14",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5a202591_15873411",
        "filename": "voltha/protos/voltha.proto",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 98,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000056
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-06-27T13:10:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How do we invoke the \u0027/api/v1/channel_partitions/{name}\u0027 API to get the required information across partitions?  If \u0027name\u0027 is just a string of characters then it won\u0027t guarantee uniqueness.  I suggest to add another id (a string of 12 hex) which would be used to query the data.  And this would apply to all objects that would be queried from the NBO api.",
      "parentUuid": "5a202591_f54a7826",
      "revId": "5d2aae373ebbdf8be698fb00cb2c3502a2c5dd14",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
