      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-06-27T13:10:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since these bbf_fiber are repeated in both voltha and volthainstance messages then I suggest to create a separate message for all of them (e.g. bbf_fiber message) and just refers to it in both voltha and volthainstance.",
